; Truncated forms. A .gro residue-name field holds only 5 characters and a
; .pdb only 4, so H_Eigen and H_Zundel cannot survive a round trip through a
; coordinate file. The truncations are listed so those two ions are still
; recognised; shortening the residue names in ions.itp would be the real fix.
H_Eig		Ion	; truncated H_Eigen
H_Zun		Ion	; truncated H_Zundel
H_EIG		Ion	; truncated H_EIGEN
H_ZUN		Ion	; truncated H_ZUNDEL
; Legacy GROMACS/AMBER aliases
NA+			Ion	; AMBER sodium
CL-			Ion	; AMBER chloride
CU1			Ion	; AMBER Cu(I)
Cal			Ion	; AMBER calcium
IB+			Ion	; AMBER generic big ion
OH			Ion	; hydroxide
